      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B9ACC778C774C5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐, 마티에르 씨가\n믿고 맡긴 사람이라면 괜찮겠지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002C0020B9C8D2F0C5D0B9740020C528AC00000ABBFFACE00020B9E1AE340020C0ACB78CC774B77CBA740020AD1CCC2EACA0C9C0002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거두절미하고 본론부터 말할게!\n이 미르에 엄청난 녀석이 나타났어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70B450C808BBF8D558ACE00020BCF8B860BD80D1300020B9D0D560AC8C0021000AC7740020BBF8B974C5D00020C5C4CCADB09C0020B140C11DC7740020B098D0C0B0ACC5B4002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그건 바로...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC740020BC14B85C002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "커어어어다란!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEE4C5B4C5B4C5B4B2E4B780002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파르빗이야!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB974BE57C774C57C00210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 파르빗보다 두 배는 더 큰,\n상상을 초월하는 크기...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n심지어 두 눈은 시뻘겋게 빛나고 있었어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020D30CB974BE57BCF4B2E40020B4500020BC30B2940020B3540020D070002C000AC0C1C0C1C7440020CD08C6D4D558B2940020D06CAE30002E002E002E00100001BE00000AC2ECC9C0C5B40020B4500020B208C7400020C2DCBED8AC8BAC8C0020BE5BB098ACE00020C788C5C8C5B4002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "녀석과 눈이 마주친 순간\n본능적으로 도망치게 되더라니까...!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n세상을 여행하며 다양한 경험을 했지만\n처음 느끼는 공포였어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "더 무시무시한 건 목격 장소야.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n목격 장소는 너무나도 평범한 뒷골목...\n와일드 존의 바깥이었다고!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B3540020BB34C2DCBB34C2DCD55C0020AC740020BAA9ACA90020C7A5C18CC57C002E00100001BE01000ABAA9ACA90020C7A5C18CB2940020B108BB34B098B3C40020D3C9BC94D55C0020B4B7ACE8BAA9002E002E002E000AC640C77CB4DC0020C874C7580020BC14AE65C774C5C8B2E4ACE0002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "녀석을 가만둘 순 없어.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n내 미션을 <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>가이드로 설정<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>한 다음\n목적지까지 와 줘!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B140C11DC7440020AC00B9CCB4580020C21C0020C5C6C5B4002E00100001BE01000AB0B40020BBF8C158C744002000100002FF000006AC00C774B4DCB85C0020C124C81500100002FF000000D55C0020B2E4C74C000ABAA9C801C9C0AE4CC9C00020C6400020C918002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
