      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대단한데!\n커다란 파르빗을 이기다니!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2E8D55CB3700021000ACEE4B2E4B7800020D30CB974BE57C7440020C774AE30B2E4B2C8002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "방금 그 배틀을 보고\n생각난 게 있어.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BC29AE080020ADF80020BC30D2C0C7440020BCF4ACE0000AC0DDAC01B09C0020AC8C0020C788C5B4002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먼 옛날, 어느 지방에서는\n몸집이 크고 눈이 빛나는 난폭한 포켓몬을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>우두머리<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>라고 부르며 다들 두려워했대.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA3C0020C61BB0A0002C0020C5B4B2900020C9C0BC29C5D0C11CB294000ABAB8C9D1C7740020D06CACE00020B208C7740020BE5BB098B2940020B09CD3EDD55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC74400100001BE00000A00100002FF000006C6B0B450BA38B9AC00100002FF000000B77CACE00020BD80B974BA700020B2E4B4E40020B450B824C6CCD588B300002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어째서 현대의 미르시티에\n그와 비슷한 포켓몬이 있는지<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n감도 안 오지만 말이야...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4C9F8C11C0020D604B300C7580020BBF8B974C2DCD2F0C5D0000AADF8C6400020BE44C2B7D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7740020C788B294C9C000100001BE01000AAC10B3C40020C5480020C624C9C0B9CC0020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이봐, 파트너.\n뭔가 불길한 예감이 들지 않아?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BD10002C0020D30CD2B8B108002E000ABB54AC000020BD88AE38D55C0020C608AC10C7740020B4E4C9C00020C54AC544003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "파르...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D30CB974002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼 고마워.\n역시 마티에르 씨가 믿고 맡긴 사람인걸?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n너 같은 사람이 있으면\n도시에 우두머리가 나타나도 걱정 없을 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
